    "data": "<p>Biliboard术力口周榜</p><p>创刊于2024年6月12日，继承自日本Billboard周榜，收录包括但不限于使用VOCALOID、UTAU、SynthesizerV、CEVIO、初音ミクNT等音声合成引擎制作的歌曲（统称“术曲”），旨在针对B站的流行趋势对术曲排名，并传播日本虚拟歌姬文化。</p><p><br/></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img class=\"cut-off-6\" alt=\"cut-off-6\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/article/02db465212d3c374a43c60fa2625cc1caeaab796.png\"/></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">排名计算方式</h1><p>0、数据统计周期为上周周二12点至本周周二12点</p><p>1、时间修正</p><p>t = LOG(EXP(DATE([投稿日期])-DATE([最近一期周榜的发布时间的前一天]))/14 + 1)+1</p><p>2、得分计算</p><p>播放基数 = 新增播放 * 时间修正</p><p>得分 = 播放基数 + 新增收藏 * 30 + 新增点赞 * 3 + 新增硬币 * 10 + (投票比值 + 100%) * 播放基数</p><p>投票&amp;提名网站: <a href=\"https://aquarite.uk\">https://aquarite.uk</a></p><p>排名并不完全等同于歌曲质量，请理性看待！</p><p><br/></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img class=\"cut-off-5\" alt=\"cut-off-5\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/article/4adb9255ada5b97061e610b682b8636764fe50ed.png\"/></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 20 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1iA5jzxEQL/\" target=\"_blank\">我想当个圣人君子</a></h1><p><br/></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/f3107b6a4a7e66e15976cecce0c93c633546800279522160.jpg\"/><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"false\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 19 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1cJ411q7GF/\" target=\"_blank\">春岚</a></h1><p><br/></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/4d6e243e00a415e5fcc460ef3c2b9f31fe37d7c8.jpg\"/><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"false\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 18 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1uJ411879Y/\" target=\"_blank\">神的随波逐流</a></h1><p><br/></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/7151a1406fce8281694bc35cee009833639b0a9a.jpg\"/><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"false\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 17 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV15J4m1A7qy/\" target=\"_blank\">催眠师</a></h1><p><br/></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/c4496e1c95132a8dd859f9ad52d92a7e58efec75.jpg\"/><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"false\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 16 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1cZw9eDERz/\" target=\"_blank\">心灵感应</a></h1><p><br/></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/b6699798fd7dec5746a126355ed50a873546800279522160.jpg\"/><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"false\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 15 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV13e7PztEGd/\" target=\"_blank\">回复还没好吗？大叔式发言！</a></h1><p><br/></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/9c364ebd891fd2fc0eecc763d6b22d492e47506a.jpg\"/><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"false\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 14 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1BGTVzTE8A/\" target=\"_blank\">城市的海滨</a></h1><p><br/></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/09303d1111de76de732451f1bd3f07378d52dd77.jpg\"/><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"false\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 13 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1j1ECzjEST/\" target=\"_blank\">游耍</a></h1><p><br/></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/3c751